      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我还很不成熟……在大家眼里，\n或许仍然只是『小西』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3baf5b2be50bc1cf89d665cff7e444f3e32600929f86130b314beb7df53920bf",
