      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……啊。也许确实如此。\n大家都把我当真正的女儿一样疼爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2352dd6c19fd00b4c4bdb0432c628993b28e11c8a1ca0f28266d912fd2c7887",
