      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是……就我而言，还是希望各位能早日将我视为\n同样引导未来跑者的人，平等相待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cb9d01a2f2600601402cac7a9e48b0ff0be9bff4415ee618515040acaddd87c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
