      "uid": "zhcn:7c40e756bb6b10701243ed64",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的……！如今或许还会被当成孩子天真的愿望，\n但总有一天一定会……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c625ba2dc4bbb798bcd8833f703fc30e5a49892df492510305aeef5f2f414178",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
