      "uid": "zhcn:62bbb7322f6bc5a1991bc4b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是的。那，都是很久以前的事了吧？\n……训练员，我们走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c597bc5ade09057af10411614ac11921aed0e7950eb17222286a9803a7c8a22c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
